                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is an old friend, I'm heartbroken that no matter what i do the game crashes and refuses to run.  I was there when it was just an old mobile game for free, and when I found it on steam I was ecstatic, unless I find a way to force it to run I probably wont be able to play it again which is sad, however this game meant so much to me growing up, if the creator sees this is there a way to force it to run on new computers? Thank you for showing me how amazing video games are when i was young",
